OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue overnight, these showers will
OL,7,Fbecome frequent and heavy at times
OL,8,Fwith some wintry. Gale north to
OL,9,Fnorthwest winds spread to western
OL,10,Fcoasts overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAnother day of blustery
OL,13,Fshowers, these wintry over high
OL,14,Fground. The gales will soon ease down
OL,15,Fby midday but strong winds continue
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
