OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,6,Fcold from Friday. Scattered showers
OL,7,FFriday merge into longer periods of
OL,8,Flocally heavy rain Saturday. Rain will
OL,9,Fclear for a time from Sunday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
